{
    "title": "Toki Mahjong Games For Seniors",
    "description": "<b>Toki Mahjong is a Classic Puzzle Game of Tile Matching.</b> Keep your brain sharp while having fun with this puzzle game of Mahjong Solitaire Game for seniors. This Mahjong game has Large tile mahjong, clear and beautiful interface. Compatible with mobile phones and tablets of all sizes. No WIFI required, you can play this Mahjong Solitaire at anytime and anywhere.\r\n\r\n<b>How to Play Toki Mahjong:</b>\r\nToki Mahjong Solitaire is a very simple and fun game. The goal is to clear all the tiles from the board by matching them in pairs. The tiles can only be paired if they have at least one side free and no other tiles on top of them. The drawings and symbols on the tiles must be the same in order for them to match. Once all tiles are eliminated, it means that the mahjong solitaire puzzle is successfully solved.\r\n\r\n<b>Why the seniors love to play Toki Mahjong Solitaire:</b>\r\nMahjong Solitaire is one of the most popular board puzzle games in the world. Many elderly people choose to play mahjong solitaire to keep their brains sharper and to kill time. Toki Mahjong Solitaire is the most classic mahjong solitaire game. Large tiles and smooth operation make it easy for the elderly to watch and operate. If you like mahjong solitaire games, please don't miss it.\r\n\r\n<b>Toki Mahjong Solitaire Game Features:</b>\r\n\ud83c\udc04 Over 1000 free levels\r\n\ud83c\udc04 Beautiful graphics and various layouts    \r\n\ud83c\udc04 Daily Challenge \u2013 well-designed brain trainer levels     \r\n\ud83c\udc04 Hints and Shuffle - to help you finish the board \r\n\ud83c\udc04 Bombs \u2013 to make solving puzzle easier\r\n\ud83c\udc04 Unlimited free undos \r\n\ud83c\udc04 Customize tiles and background \r\n\ud83c\udc04 Highlight free tiles \r\n\ud83c\udc04 Easy matching gameplay\r\n\ud83c\udc04 No WIFI needed \u2013 you can play offline anytime and anywhere\r\n\r\nToki Mahjong Solitaire is a free puzzle game designed to help seniors keep their brains sharp and improve their memory.\r\nDon't hesitate, play this free Mahjong Solitaire game <b>NOW</b>!",
